2e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"赵湖州东园杂咏和人韵 一勺","author":"陈文蔚","text":"吞梦胸襟纳九江，等閒领客醉壶觞。\n爱将万事寻源委，锄到云间得秘藏。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":15100,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"赵湖州东园杂咏和人韵 先春堂","author":"陈文蔚","text":"芳园十亩面东开，春色知从此地来。\n门外风光浑未觉，堂前早已发桃梅。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":15101,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"赵湖州东园杂咏和人韵 宾日","author":"陈文蔚","text":"著眼高时四海空，何须服日脸霞红。\n清朝坐对升旸谷，万里云烟在古风。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":15102,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"赵湖州东园杂咏和人韵 隽游","author":"陈文蔚","text":"亭据高峰上上头，登临人世一沤浮。\n嚣尘到此都遗尽，直欲乘风跨鹤游。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":15103,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"赵湖州东园杂咏和人韵 邀月","author":"陈文蔚","text":"远乐数声闻玉箫，酒酣起舞月中宵。\n谪仙当日真豪放，明镜飞空许见邀。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":15104,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"赵湖州东园杂咏和人韵 矍圃","author":"陈文蔚","text":"剔攘取予见经纶，中的工人又日新。\n一醉使君豪气发，颇思三箭定胡人。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":15105,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba0